> what is the square root of x plus 1?
  note: what does "the square root of" apply to: read as sqrt(x) + ..., not sqrt(x + ...) (say "the square root of the quantity ..." for the second)
  ucas: it(x) = sqrt(x) + 1
  ucas: show it
it(x: real) = sqrt(x) + 1
  -> real
> what is the square root of the quantity x plus 1?
  ucas: it(x) = sqrt(x + 1)
  ucas: show it
it(x: real) = sqrt(x + 1)
  -> real
> is x + 1 squared equal to x^2 + 2x + 1 for u8 x?
  ucas: it(x: u8) = x + 1^2
  ucas: that(x: u8) = x^2 + 2*x + 1
  ucas: equiv it that
it and that differ at 254 points, e.g. x=1: 2 vs 4
> is the square of x + 1 equal to x^2 + 2*x + 1 for u8 x?
  note: what does "the square of" apply to: read as (x)^2 + ..., not (x + ...)^2 (say "the square of the quantity ..." for the second)
  ucas: it(x: u8) = x^2 + 1
  ucas: that(x: u8) = x^2 + 2*x + 1
  ucas: equiv it that
it and that differ at 254 points, e.g. x=1: 2 vs 4
